# --- @fill: sinn conjugation -------------------------------------------------
# The core grammar here is pronoun + correct form of sinn. Distractors are
# wrong-person forms of the SAME verb, forcing the learner to match person.

@fill
@lu Ech [sinn] frou.
@en I [am] happy.
@distractor-lu bass
@distractor-lu ass
@distractor-lu sidd
@distractor-en is
@distractor-en are
@distractor-en has

@fill
@lu Du [bass] de Riichter.
@en You [are] the judge.
@distractor-lu sinn
@distractor-lu ass
@distractor-lu sidd
@distractor-en am
@distractor-en is
@distractor-en has

@fill
@lu Hatt [ass] d'Bäckesch.
@en She [is] the baker.
@distractor-lu sinn
@distractor-lu bass
@distractor-lu sidd
@distractor-en am
@distractor-en are
@distractor-en have

@fill
@lu Dir [sidd] d'Frëndinnen.
@en You [are] the friends.
@distractor-lu sinn
@distractor-lu bass
@distractor-lu ass
@distractor-en am
@distractor-en is
@distractor-en has

@fill
@lu Si [sinn] op der Gare.
