# --- @fill: question words ----------------------------------------------------
# Wat/Wien/Wou/Wéi confusion is a genuine A1 pain point. All blanks are
# sentence-initial so no Eifeler-Regel risk. Frames use vocabulary from
# this lesson, distinct from the question-word fills in A1_04/A1_05/A1_08.

@fill
@lu [Wien] ass de Mann?
@en [Who] is the man?
@distractor-lu Wat
@distractor-lu Wou
@distractor-lu Wéi
@distractor-en What
@distractor-en Where
@distractor-en How

